 "remarks": "RARE OPPORTUNITY IN EAST NORWALK! Beautifully remodeled, move-in-ready one-bedroom condo on the first floor, in a prime East Norwalk location. Enjoy easy living with modern updates, including recessed lighting, LVP/tile flooring, updated cabinetry, quartz countertops, stainless steel appliances and central air. The extra-large bedroom features a walk-in-closet with built ins, offering plenty of space and comfort. Just a short walk to Metro North, Calf Pasture Beach, Veterans Park, SONO, Sono Collections Mall, local restaurants and shops. Quick access to 1-95, RT 7 and the Merritt Parkway makes commuting a breeze. Includes 2 off-street parking spaces and plenty of street parking as well. Schedule your private showing today!",
